{
    "id": "synology_smb",
    "label": {
        "en_EN": "Synology — SMB (SYNOLOGY-SMB-MIB)",
        "es_ES": "Synology — SMB (SYNOLOGY-SMB-MIB)"
    },
    "description": {
        "en_EN": "What the file service is actually doing, which on a NAS is the whole point: what each smbd process is costing in CPU, how many commands a second are being served and how long each kind takes, and the same for read and write packets. Latency per command is the number that answers \"why does the share feel slow\" — the interface counters can be flat and the volume idle while a client waits on every open.",
        "es_ES": "Lo que está haciendo de verdad el servicio de ficheros, que en un NAS es de lo que va todo: lo que cuesta en CPU cada proceso smbd, cuántos comandos por segundo se sirven y cuánto tarda cada tipo, y lo mismo para los paquetes de lectura y escritura. La latencia por comando es el número que contesta a «por qué va lento el recurso compartido» — los contadores de la interfaz pueden estar planos y el volumen ocioso mientras un cliente espera en cada apertura."
    },
    "match": {
        "sysobjectid_prefix": "1.3.6.1.4.1.6574",
        "probe": "1.3.6.1.4.1.6574.111.2.1.2.0"
    },
    "metrics": [
        {
            "key": "smb_cmd_ps",
            "label": {"en_EN": "Commands per second", "es_ES": "Comandos por segundo"},
            "walk": "1.3.6.1.4.1.6574.111.2.1.3",
            "kind": "gauge",
            "unit": "cmd/s",
            "chart": "line",
            "group": "cmd",
            "index_label": "1.3.6.1.4.1.6574.111.2.1.2"
        },
        {
            "key": "smb_cmd_latency",
            "label": {"en_EN": "Command latency", "es_ES": "Latencia del comando"},
            "walk": "1.3.6.1.4.1.6574.111.2.1.4",
            "kind": "gauge",
            "unit": "",
            "chart": "line",
            "group": "cmd",
            "index_label": "1.3.6.1.4.1.6574.111.2.1.2"
        },
        {
            "key": "smb_rw_ps",
            "label": {"en_EN": "Read/write packets per second", "es_ES": "Paquetes de lectura/escritura por segundo"},
            "walk": "1.3.6.1.4.1.6574.111.3.1.3",
            "kind": "gauge",
            "unit": "pkt/s",
            "chart": "line",
            "group": "rw",
            "index_label": "1.3.6.1.4.1.6574.111.3.1.2"
        },
        {
            "key": "smb_rw_latency",
            "label": {"en_EN": "Read/write latency", "es_ES": "Latencia de lectura/escritura"},
            "walk": "1.3.6.1.4.1.6574.111.3.1.4",
            "kind": "gauge",
            "unit": "",
            "chart": "line",
            "group": "rw",
            "index_label": "1.3.6.1.4.1.6574.111.3.1.2"
        },
        {
            "key": "smb_cpu_user",
            "label": {"en_EN": "CPU (user)", "es_ES": "CPU (usuario)"},
            "walk": "1.3.6.1.4.1.6574.111.1.1.3",
            "kind": "gauge",
            "unit": "%",
            "chart": "line",
            "group": "cpu",
